      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sabh pahichaano ||798||",
      "translation": "Utter firstly the word “Ambujani” and then “Jaa-char-pati-shatru” and comprehend the names of Tupak.798.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਾਰੇ ਤੁਪਕ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਵਜੋਂ ਪਛਾਣੋ ॥੭੯੮॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक के सभ पहिचानो ॥७९८॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107915",
      "sourceShabadId": "9528",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0026",
      "lineIndex": 26,
      "gurmukhi": "ਦੋਹਰਾ ॥",
      "transliteration": "dhoharaa ||",
      "translation": "DOHRA",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਦੋਹਰਾ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "दोहरा ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107916",
      "sourceShabadId": "9529",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0027",
      "lineIndex": 27,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਾਰਿਨਿ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ਜਾ ਚਰ ਧਰ ਪਦ ਦੇਹੁ ॥",
      "transliteration": "baarin aadh uchaar kai jaa char dhar padh dheh ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਰਿਨਿ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ, ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਧਰ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बारिनि आदि उचारि कै जा चर धर पद देहु ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107917",
      "sourceShabadId": "9529",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0028",
      "lineIndex": 28,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਉਚਾਰੁ ਤੁਫੰਗ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਚਤੁਰ ਲਖਿ ਲੇਹੁ ॥੭੯੯॥",
      "transliteration": "satr uchaar tufa(n)g ke naam chatur lakh leh ||799||",
      "translation": "Utter firstly the word “Vaarini” and then “Jaa-char-dhar and shatru”, and comprehend the names of Tupak in your mind.799.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਹੋ। (ਇਸ ਤਰ੍ਰਹਾ) ਤੁਫੰਗ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ (ਬਣਦਾ ਹੈ)। ਵਿਦਵਾਨ ਸੋਚ ਲੈਣ ॥੭੯੯॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु उचारु तुफंग के नाम चतुर लखि लेहु ॥७९९॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107918",
      "sourceShabadId": "9529",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅੜਿਲ ॥",
      "transliteration": "aRil ||",
      "translation": "ARIL",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅੜਿਲ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अड़िल ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107919",
      "sourceShabadId": "9530",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਬਾਰਿਜਨੀ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਉਚਾਰੋ ਜਾਨਿ ਕੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "baarijanee sabadhaadh uchaaro jaan kai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਬਾਰਿਜਨੀ' (ਧਰਤੀ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "बारिजनी सबदादि उचारो जानि कै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107920",
      "sourceShabadId": "9530",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਪਤਿ ਪਦ ਕੋ ਤਿਹ ਪਾਛੇ ਠਾਨਿ ਕੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char pat padh ko teh paachhe Thaan kai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਪਤਿ' ਪਦ ਨੂੰ ਪਿਛੋਂ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर पति पद को तिह पाछे ठानि कै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107921",
      "sourceShabadId": "9530",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0032",
      "lineIndex": 32,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko taa ke a(n)t uchaar kai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਫਿਰ) ਉਸ ਦੇ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को ता के अंति उचारि कै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107922",
      "sourceShabadId": "9530",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0033",
      "lineIndex": 33,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋ ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਸੁ ਲੇਹੁ ਬਿਚਾਰਿ ਕੈ ॥੮੦੦॥",
      "transliteration": "ho sakal tupak ke naam su leh bichaar kai ||800||",
      "translation": "Uttering firstly the word “Vaarijani” and then speaking “Jaa-char-pati-shatru”, consider and remember all the names of Tupak.800.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਹ) ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਏਗਾ। ਸਾਰੇ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਕਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੮੦੦॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हो सकल तुपक के नाम सु लेहु बिचारि कै ॥८००॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107923",
      "sourceShabadId": "9530",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0034",
      "lineIndex": 34,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਲਨਿਧਨੀ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕੀਜੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jalanidhanee sabadhaadh uchaaran keejeeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਜਲਨਿਧਨੀ' (ਧਰਤੀ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰ ਕੇ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जलनिधनी सबदादि उचारन कीजीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107924",
      "sourceShabadId": "9530",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0035",
      "lineIndex": 35,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਬਹੁਰੋ ਦੀਜੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh bahuro dheejeeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद बहुरो दीजीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107925",
      "sourceShabadId": "9530",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0036",
      "lineIndex": 36,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਤਾ ਕੇ ਅੰਤਿ ਉਚਾਰੀਐ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko taa ke a(n)t uchaareeaai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਅੰਤ ਉਤੇ ਰਖੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को ता के अंति उचारीऐ ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107926",
      "sourceShabadId": "9530",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0037",
      "lineIndex": 37,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹੋ ਸਕਲ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਨਾਮ ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨ ਬਿਚਾਰੀਐ ॥੮੦੧॥",
      "transliteration": "ho sakal tupak ke naam prabeen bichaareeaai ||801||",
      "translation": "After firstly saying “Jalnidhani”, utter the words “Jaa-char-nayak and shatrua” and comprehend all the names of Tupak.801.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਹ) ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਬਣ ਜਾਏਗਾ। ਸਭ ਪ੍ਰਬੀਨ ਵਿਚਾਰ ਲੈਣ ॥੮੦੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हो सकल तुपक के नाम प्रबीन बिचारीऐ ॥८०१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107927",
      "sourceShabadId": "9530",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0038",
      "lineIndex": 38,
      "gurmukhi": "ਚੌਪਈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chauapiee ||",
      "translation": "CHUPAI",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਚੌਪਈ:",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "चौपई ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107928",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0039",
      "lineIndex": 39,
      "gurmukhi": "ਮੇਘਜਨੀ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਉਚਾਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "meghajanee sabadhaadh uchaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਮੇਘਜਨੀ' (ਧਰਤੀ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "मेघजनी सबदादि उचारो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107929",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0040",
      "lineIndex": 40,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਡਾਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh ddaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद डारो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107930",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0041",
      "lineIndex": 41,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਭਣਿਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur bhanijai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਨੂੰ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि भणिजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107931",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0042",
      "lineIndex": 42,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਫੰਗ ਜਾਨ ਜੀਅ ਲੀਜੈ ॥੮੦੨॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tufa(n)g jaan jeea leejai ||802||",
      "translation": "After firstly saying the word “Meghjani”, utter the words “Jaa-char-nayak and shatru” and know the names of Tupak.802.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਤੁਫੰਗ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਮਨ ਵਿਚ ਸਮਝ ਲਵੋ ॥੮੦੨॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुफंग जान जीअ लीजै ॥८०२॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107932",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0043",
      "lineIndex": 43,
      "gurmukhi": "ਅੰਬੁਦਨੀ ਸਬਦਾਦਿ ਬਖਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "a(n)budhanee sabadhaadh bakhaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਅੰਬੁਦਨੀ' (ਪਾਣੀ ਦੇ ਸਾਗਰਾ ਵਾਲੀ ਧਰਤੀ) ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "अंबुदनी सबदादि बखानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107933",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0044",
      "lineIndex": 44,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਠਾਨੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh Thaano ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद ठानो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107934",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0045",
      "lineIndex": 45,
      "gurmukhi": "ਸਤ੍ਰੁ ਸਬਦ ਕੋ ਬਹੁਰਿ ਉਚਾਰੋ ॥",
      "transliteration": "satr sabadh ko bahur uchaaro ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਸਤ੍ਰੁ' ਸ਼ਬਦ ਦਾ ਕਥਨ ਕਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "सत्रु सबद को बहुरि उचारो ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107935",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0046",
      "lineIndex": 46,
      "gurmukhi": "ਨਾਮ ਤੁਪਕ ਕੇ ਸਕਲ ਬਿਚਾਰੋ ॥੮੦੩॥",
      "transliteration": "naam tupak ke sakal bichaaro ||803||",
      "translation": "Know all the names of Tupak after firstly saying the word “Ambujni” and then uttering “Jaa-char-nayak and shatru”.803.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਇਸ ਨੂੰ) ਸਭ ਤੁਪਕ ਦਾ ਨਾਮ ਵਿਚਾਰੋ ॥੮੦੩॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "नाम तुपक के सकल बिचारो ॥८०३॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107936",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0047",
      "lineIndex": 47,
      "gurmukhi": "ਹਰਿਨੀ ਆਦਿ ਉਚਾਰਨ ਕੀਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "harinee aadh uchaaran keejai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਪਹਿਲਾ 'ਹਰਿਨੀ' (ਧਰਤੀ) ਸ਼ਬਦ ਉਚਾਰੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "हरिनी आदि उचारन कीजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107937",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0759_line_0048",
      "lineIndex": 48,
      "gurmukhi": "ਜਾ ਚਰ ਕਹਿ ਨਾਇਕ ਪਦ ਦੀਜੈ ॥",
      "transliteration": "jaa char keh naik padh dheejai ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਫਿਰ 'ਜਾ ਚਰ ਨਾਇਕ' ਪਦ ਜੋੜੋ।",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 759,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "जा चर कहि नाइक पद दीजै ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "107938",
      "sourceShabadId": "9531",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    }
  ]
}
